OL,3,GNEWSAAre wealthy buyers stoking St
OL,4,AAndrews' housing crisis?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA world class university and the home
OL,7,Fof golf in a pretty coastal town
OL,8,Funderline the appeal to many of living
OL,9,Fin St Andrews.
OL,11,FBut the Fife town is in the grips of an
OL,12,Faffordable housing crisis, where
OL,13,Fproperty prices are being stoked by the
OL,14,Finfluence of wealthy buyers from
OL,15,Foutwith Scotland.
OL,17,FNew data shows nearly one in five
OL,18,Fproperties in St Andrews were
OL,19,Fregistered to an address outside of
OL,20,FScotland when purchased, including 164
OL,21,Fbuyers from the United States alone.
